 # Delete the redundant standalone CLI smoke tests
 
 Doug decided on design grounds, not as a timing remedy: packages/cli/standalone_cli_smoke.test.ts spawns six CLI processes whose assertions devtools/packedCli.test.ts already makes against the installed tarball (--version, --help flag, runtime Pi import), or that test Pi rather than Sandpiper (list reads settings). Delete the file. Keep the one uncovered property, single registration of --identity by default, as an assertion on the packed test's existing --help output with no new spawn. Accepted loss: the source entrypoint (bun run sandpiper-dev) has no startup test. Place the change directly after mwqvznwo so every simplification unit is gated without the file.
